# ── VentureReady configuration template ───────────────────────────
# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in the real values.
# The real ".env" is git-ignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Zoho Creator API — used for TiE Bangalore membership verification at login.
# Without these, the membership check is disabled (the rest of the app still runs).
ZOHO_CLIENT_ID=your-zoho-client-id-here
ZOHO_CLIENT_SECRET=your-zoho-client-secret-here

# Google sign-in ("Continue with Google"). This is the PUBLIC OAuth Client ID
# from Google Cloud Console (APIs & Services → Credentials → OAuth client, type
# "Web application"). It is safe to expose to the browser — there is NO secret to
# set here for this flow. Add http://localhost:8000 (and your live URL) as an
# "Authorized JavaScript origin" on that credential. If left blank, the Google
# button falls back to the demo sign-in and the rest of the app still runs.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-oauth-client-id-here

# TiE Bangalore membership page. VentureReady does NOT take membership payments
# — TiE's own membership page (Zoho) owns the membership record, so the "Join TiE
# Bangalore" buttons hand off to this URL and the app then re-checks membership
# against Zoho. Founders should choose "Associate Membership" (₹10,000 + GST/yr)
# from the drop-down on that page. If this is left blank the join buttons are
# hidden and founders are told to email admin.blr@tiebangalore.org instead.
TIE_MEMBERSHIP_URL=

# Razorpay payment link for the one-time expert review (₹3,000 + GST). Payment
# happens on Razorpay, not in this app: the "Proceed with Expert Review" button
# opens this link and records that the founder went to pay, so admins can
# reconcile it in the Razorpay dashboard. If left blank, the button falls back
# to the in-app demo checkout. Paste a Razorpay Payment Link (rzp.io/...) here.
EXPERT_REVIEW_PAYMENT_URL=

# Anthropic API — powers the live AI positioning diagnostic.
# If left blank, the app falls back to a canned sample result (no live AI).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here

# Optional: pin a specific Claude model. Leave blank to use the default.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# Admin / Team-Portal access allow-list. Only Google-verified emails on the list
# may enter the admin portal — this is an explicit list, NOT the whole
# @tiebangalore.org domain. The list is managed from inside the portal by a
# super-admin; ADMIN_EMAILS below is only the FIRST-RUN seed for extra admins:
# ADMIN_EMAILS=priya@tiebangalore.org,ritu@tiebangalore.org
ADMIN_EMAILS=
# Super-admins (comma-separated) can add/remove admins in-app and cannot be
# removed. Defaults to admin.blr@tiebangalore.org and chinmay@tiebangalore.org.
# ADMIN_SUPER_EMAILS=admin.blr@tiebangalore.org,chinmay@tiebangalore.org
